  "contentHtml": "<p><b>별것은 아니지만 저도 공유라는 걸 해 봅니다.&#160;</b></p><p>&#160;</p><p><b>도움이 될지는 모르겠지만... 저는 각자 교과서에 그래프를 다 그리게 하고</b></p><p>&#160;</p><p><b>먼저 그린 친구들이 조별로 얻은 결과를 엑셀에 입력하도록 시킵니다. (대표 1명만 하면됨)</b></p><p>&#160;</p><p><b>장점은 각조의 결과를 한꺼번에 확인할 수 있다는 점이죠.&#160;</b></p><p>&#160;</p><p><b>이 창에서 각각의 값을 입력하면&#160;</b></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/460413747c3937322bf441061bc4cf4d8527678f\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"694\" height=\"398\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/460413747c3937322bf441061bc4cf4d8527678f\" data-origin-width=\"1115\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>이렇게 아래와 같이 바로 그래프가 나옵니다.&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cef78566f50401dd1c18c6f006e61691f5717903\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"716\" height=\"427\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cef78566f50401dd1c18c6f006e61691f5717903\" data-origin-width=\"1081\" data-origin-height=\"644\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>&#160;주의점 : 다른반&#160; sheet추가할 때 sheet자체를 복사해서 쓰세요.&#160;&#160;</b></span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>&#160;&#160;</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4f54e0b1c45ad8db6c31df86ae8004808a76a9b6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4f54e0b1c45ad8db6c31df86ae8004808a76a9b6\" data-origin-width=\"234\" data-origin-height=\"289\"></div><p>복사본 만들기 체크하셔서&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d84f2250db01304189384107c96ba71e63145039\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d84f2250db01304189384107c96ba71e63145039\" data-origin-width=\"293\" data-origin-height=\"398\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>새롭게 생성된 시트 이름만 바꾸시면 됩니다.</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ae5af7ecfbaec3c3a5a2466167cdb437fbbd4bee?download\" data-file-name=\"전류와 전압.xlsx\" data-file-size=\"35655\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D1319%26fileid%3D5%26regdt%3D20240329122454&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fae5af7ecfbaec3c3a5a2466167cdb437fbbd4bee')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">전류와 전압</span><span class=\"type\">.xlsx</span></div><div class=\"size\">34.82KB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
